          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ગણગણવું (gaṇgaṇvũ) is inherited. It comes from ganagana, \"murmur\", a reconstructed form that imitates the sound; CDIAL lists Gujarati gaṇgaṇvũ, \"murmur\" (CDIAL 4013)."
